<Item XName="Equations" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>% ------------------------------ Sim Configuration ------------------------------&#x000D;&#x000A;fc = 28e9; % Hz, carrier frequency&#x000D;&#x000A;OversamplingOption = 0; % oversampling ratio option&#x000D;&#x000A;NumUsers = 1; % number of users&#x000D;&#x000A;CellID_Sector = 0; % the index of cell identity within the physical-layer cell-identity group&#x000D;&#x000A;CellID_Group = 0; % the index of cell identity group&#x000D;&#x000A;n_ID = 0; % provided by higher layers for DMRS generation&#x000D;&#x000A;n_SCID = 0; % provided by DCI for DMRS generation&#x000D;&#x000A;n_xPDCCH_ID = 0; % provided by higher layers for DMRS generation&#x000D;&#x000A;n_RNTI = 1; % radio network temporary identifier&#x000D;&#x000A;SubframeIgnored = 1; % number of subframes (or transport blocks) that are ignored at the beginning due to system delay&#x000D;&#x000A;BSI_ReportDelay = 1; % BSI report delay per V5G.213&#x000D;&#x000A;BI_Rx_Delay = 1; % beam index delay in receiver side&#x000D;&#x000A;SYNC_En_Delay = 1; % SYNC_En delay in receiver side&#x000D;&#x000A;MMSE_RBWinLen = 3; % number of RBs for each MMSE-2D interpolation&#x000D;&#x000A;Tmax = 0.002/(30.72e6*5); % the maximum delay of multi-path channel. (used by 2D-MMSE channel estimator in PDSCH)&#x000D;&#x000A;PCRS_Enable = 0; % whether to enable PCRS transmission&#x000D;&#x000A;PCRS_Ports_Config = 2; % the antenna port(s) configuration for PCRS&#x000D;&#x000A;PRACH_Configuration = 1; % PRACH configuration&#x000D;&#x000A;T_ePBCH = 0; % ePBCH transmission periodicity as in Table 6.5.A.4-1 of V5G211&#x000D;&#x000A;SearchSpaceIndex = 0; % search space index for xPDCCH assignment, the range is [0, 14]&#x000D;&#x000A;SelectedUser = 1; % selected users to analysis in the receiver side, currently, it should be 1 constantly.&#x000D;&#x000A;HARQ_Enable = 0; % whether HARQ closed-loop transmission is enabled&#x000D;&#x000A;NumHARQ = 8; % number of HARQ processes for each user&#x000D;&#x000A;MaxHARQTrans = 4; % maximum number of HARQ transmission per each HARQ process for each user&#x000D;&#x000A;% ------------------------------ Other System Configurations ------------------------------&#x000D;&#x000A;fs = 30.72e6 * 5 * 2^(OversamplingOption);&#x000D;&#x000A;NumOfInterestedPorts = (AP_Layer_Config &gt; 3) + 1;&#x000D;&#x000A;if TransmissionMode == 0 % if diversity is selected, &#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;NumOfInterestedPorts = 1;&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;% ------------------------------ SNR configuration ------------------------------&#x000D;&#x000A;% the first &quot;10&quot; means 10dBm set by default in the design&#x000D;&#x000A;NDensity = 10 - 10*log10(1200*75e3) - SNR;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
<Item XName="BPMgr" Type="BPMgr">
<BPLines><T>Empty</T></BPLines>
<BPStates><T>Empty</T></BPStates></Item>
